  "duration_s": 175.518005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "当别人说你真漂亮，你就说我就喜欢跟你这种品味高的人打交道。别人又说认识你，很高兴，你就说放心吧，我会让你一直高兴下去的。和领导一起吃饭，领导笑眯眯的说，哎呀，和漂亮的女孩子吃饭呀，不用喝酒就已经醉了，这个时候你应该怎么回复呢？高情商的回复，你还没沾酒，我就先沾光了。超高情商怎么说？漂亮的女孩千篇一律，有趣的领导万里挑一。你去咖啡馆买了一杯咖啡，拿起手机，你拍了一张照片，结果呢被店员说没见过世面，喝杯咖啡还拍照，那你怎么怼回去呢？低情商的说怎么了？你有意见吗？高情商的回答，拍照是我的日常端，咖啡是你的生活。当别人问你一个月工资多少的时候，你就回比以前好多了。现在吃泡面，我敢放两根。长了当有人问领导a跟领导b你更喜欢谁的时候，你就回，对领导怎么能叫喜欢呢？那得叫尊敬两位领到，我都很尊敬领导，夸你能干，你怎么回呢？强将手下无弱兵嘛，都是您领导有方，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？饭局上别人夸你酒量好，那你该怎么回呢？高情商的回复酒量好不好？那得看跟谁喝，今天跟您喝心情好，就多贪了两杯。你去看望领导，领导说呀，下次来千万别带礼物了，都不是外人。这个时候你该怎么回答呢？错误的回答是，好的，领导，我知道了。高情商的回答，您看您不仅是我的长辈，还是我的领导，这些啊不算是礼物，而是我的心意，也是我的祝福。领导在公司群里发了一万的红包，庆祝公司业绩。好家伙，你首庆最佳竟然抢了六千六百六十六。这个时候领导说了，小李啊，手气不错呀，你该怎么回呢？高情商的回复是，手气比不上您的大气超。高情商的回复是，领导您的大气成就了我的手气。有您这样的领导是大家的福气。这个世界上真的没有人会讨厌那些会说话、会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里边，有一句话，我特别欣赏。他说，当对象给你发红包时，高情商回答，你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。当同事向你借钱，不想借时，你就回。大家都是同样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？当心仪的女生说我想你时，高情商回答，随便想，千万别跟我客气，目前不收费。我读到这段的时候，我觉得这个让我真是异解心开啊。每家的书架上不应该有一套这样的书吗？就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你我觉得这书适合所有人。所以强烈推荐你看看这套书这本书，真的可以帮助到大家，建议大家买回去看一看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 50,
      "end_ms": 1710,
      "text": "当别人说你真漂亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2030,
      "end_ms": 5430,
      "text": "你就说我就喜欢跟你这种品味高的人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5510,
      "end_ms": 6810,
      "text": "别人又说认识你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6810,
      "end_ms": 7530,
      "text": "很高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7790,
      "end_ms": 8910,
      "text": "你就说放心吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9330,
      "end_ms": 11410,
      "text": "我会让你一直高兴下去的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11410,
      "end_ms": 12490,
      "text": "和领导一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12610,
      "end_ms": 13690,
      "text": "领导笑眯眯的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14010,
      "end_ms": 14410,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14430,
      "end_ms": 16030,
      "text": "和漂亮的女孩子吃饭呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16050,
      "end_ms": 17570,
      "text": "不用喝酒就已经醉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17730,
      "end_ms": 19430,
      "text": "这个时候你应该怎么回复呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19430,
      "end_ms": 20390,
      "text": "高情商的回复，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20550,
      "end_ms": 21310,
      "text": "你还没沾酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 21310,
      "end_ms": 22310,
      "text": "我就先沾光了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 22630,
      "end_ms": 23770,
      "text": "超高情商怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 24050,
      "end_ms": 25710,
      "text": "漂亮的女孩千篇一律，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 25850,
      "end_ms": 27390,
      "text": "有趣的领导万里挑一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 27450,
      "end_ms": 29130,
      "text": "你去咖啡馆买了一杯咖啡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 29410,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "拿起手机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 30120,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "你拍了一张照片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 31600,
      "end_ms": 33880,
      "text": "结果呢被店员说没见过世面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 34000,
      "end_ms": 35320,
      "text": "喝杯咖啡还拍照，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 35760,
      "end_ms": 36820,
      "text": "那你怎么怼回去呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 37540,
      "end_ms": 39240,
      "text": "低情商的说怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 39680,
      "end_ms": 40600,
      "text": "你有意见吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 40680,
      "end_ms": 41780,
      "text": "高情商的回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 42040,
      "end_ms": 43700,
      "text": "拍照是我的日常端，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 43720,
      "end_ms": 44900,
      "text": "咖啡是你的生活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 45020,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "当别人问你一个月工资多少的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 47760,
      "end_ms": 49260,
      "text": "你就回比以前好多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 49520,
      "end_ms": 50460,
      "text": "现在吃泡面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 50460,
      "end_ms": 51300,
      "text": "我敢放两根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 51300,
      "end_ms": 56020,
      "text": "长了当有人问领导a跟领导b你更喜欢谁的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 56020,
      "end_ms": 56500,
      "text": "你就回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 56840,
      "end_ms": 58420,
      "text": "对领导怎么能叫喜欢呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 58420,
      "end_ms": 60190,
      "text": "那得叫尊敬两位领到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 60190,
      "end_ms": 61450,
      "text": "我都很尊敬领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 61450,
      "end_ms": 62190,
      "text": "夸你能干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 62510,
      "end_ms": 63310,
      "text": "你怎么回呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 63530,
      "end_ms": 65055,
      "text": "强将手下无弱兵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 65380,
      "end_ms": 66580,
      "text": "都是您领导有方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 66920,
      "end_ms": 68305,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 68550,
      "end_ms": 70430,
      "text": "饭局上别人夸你酒量好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 70690,
      "end_ms": 72150,
      "text": "那你该怎么回呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 72270,
      "end_ms": 74195,
      "text": "高情商的回复酒量好不好？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 74420,
      "end_ms": 75445,
      "text": "那得看跟谁喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 75900,
      "end_ms": 77280,
      "text": "今天跟您喝心情好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 77340,
      "end_ms": 78220,
      "text": "就多贪了两杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 78220,
      "end_ms": 79220,
      "text": "你去看望领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 79400,
      "end_ms": 80115,
      "text": "领导说呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 80390,
      "end_ms": 81985,
      "text": "下次来千万别带礼物了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 82200,
      "end_ms": 82940,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 83200,
      "end_ms": 85025,
      "text": "这个时候你该怎么回答呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 85530,
      "end_ms": 86430,
      "text": "错误的回答是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 86550,
      "end_ms": 86910,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 86910,
      "end_ms": 87310,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 87310,
      "end_ms": 87950,
      "text": "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 87950,
      "end_ms": 89010,
      "text": "高情商的回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 89010,
      "end_ms": 91030,
      "text": "您看您不仅是我的长辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 91090,
      "end_ms": 91965,
      "text": "还是我的领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 92250,
      "end_ms": 93425,
      "text": "这些啊不算是礼物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 93670,
      "end_ms": 94655,
      "text": "而是我的心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 94980,
      "end_ms": 95920,
      "text": "也是我的祝福。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 96060,
      "end_ms": 97920,
      "text": "领导在公司群里发了一万的红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 97920,
      "end_ms": 98884,
      "text": "庆祝公司业绩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 99230,
      "end_ms": 99810,
      "text": "好家伙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 99810,
      "end_ms": 102110,
      "text": "你首庆最佳竟然抢了六千六百六十六。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 102310,
      "end_ms": 103285,
      "text": "这个时候领导说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 103460,
      "end_ms": 103980,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 104060,
      "end_ms": 104940,
      "text": "手气不错呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 104940,
      "end_ms": 105880,
      "text": "你该怎么回呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 105880,
      "end_ms": 107060,
      "text": "高情商的回复是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 107200,
      "end_ms": 109310,
      "text": "手气比不上您的大气超。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 109310,
      "end_ms": 110355,
      "text": "高情商的回复是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 110620,
      "end_ms": 112995,
      "text": "领导您的大气成就了我的手气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 113500,
      "end_ms": 115840,
      "text": "有您这样的领导是大家的福气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 115980,
      "end_ms": 119475,
      "text": "这个世界上真的没有人会讨厌那些会说话、会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 119800,
      "end_ms": 120820,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 120840,
      "end_ms": 121480,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 121480,
      "end_ms": 122240,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 122360,
      "end_ms": 123565,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 123930,
      "end_ms": 125910,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 125990,
      "end_ms": 128115,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 128400,
      "end_ms": 129460,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 129640,
      "end_ms": 130940,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 131060,
      "end_ms": 133395,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 133730,
      "end_ms": 134650,
      "text": "在这本书里边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 134650,
      "end_ms": 135170,
      "text": "有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 135170,
      "end_ms": 136010,
      "text": "我特别欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 136070,
      "end_ms": 136410,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 136550,
      "end_ms": 137970,
      "text": "当对象给你发红包时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 137970,
      "end_ms": 138785,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 139040,
      "end_ms": 140905,
      "text": "你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 141160,
      "end_ms": 142160,
      "text": "当同事向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 142160,
      "end_ms": 142860,
      "text": "不想借时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 142920,
      "end_ms": 143380,
      "text": "你就回。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 143580,
      "end_ms": 144855,
      "text": "大家都是同样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 145080,
      "end_ms": 145660,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 145680,
      "end_ms": 146360,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 146440,
      "end_ms": 148420,
      "text": "当心仪的女生说我想你时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 148560,
      "end_ms": 149435,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 149700,
      "end_ms": 150260,
      "text": "随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 150300,
      "end_ms": 151480,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 151580,
      "end_ms": 152505,
      "text": "目前不收费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 152900,
      "end_ms": 153900,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 153900,
      "end_ms": 156320,
      "text": "我觉得这个让我真是异解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 156460,
      "end_ms": 158845,
      "text": "每家的书架上不应该有一套这样的书吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 159090,
      "end_ms": 162155,
      "text": "就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 162500,
      "end_ms": 165140,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 165160,
      "end_ms": 166380,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 166440,
      "end_ms": 169415,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你我觉得这书适合所有人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 169810,
      "end_ms": 172450,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐你看看这套书这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 172450,
      "end_ms": 173645,
      "text": "真的可以帮助到大家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a1a4516178db3f0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 173990,
      "end_ms": 175385,
      "text": "建议大家买回去看一看。"
    }
  ],
